"""Static metadata for the agreed GWDG metric categories.

Each short_name is a unique uppercase mnemonic of at most seven letters.
Notes describe the raw quantity; counter interpretation requires changes or rates
and reset handling. Unknown type or null unit means the definition is unverified.

Sources:
https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter/tree/master/collector
https://github.com/NVIDIA/dcgm-exporter/blob/4.1.1-4.0.4/etc/default-counters.csv
https://github.com/NVIDIA/dcgm-exporter/blob/main/etc/default-counters.csv
Local dataset SCHEMA.md defines the three Slurm quantities.

Conntrack and vmstat cumulative quantities use counter interpretation even when
exporter wire types are gauges or untyped. NVLink bandwidth remains unknown because
exporter versions disagree and the dataset does not identify its exporter version.
"""


def _meta(short_name, kind, unit, note):
    return {"short_name": short_name, "type": kind, "unit": unit, "note": note}


